## Why This Is Asked
Tests ability to design retrieval-augmented systems for live NLP in finance, balancing latency, privacy, multilingual support, and explainability.

## Key Concepts
- Retrieval-augmented NLP with real-time fact-checking
- Time-aligned financial data integration (pricing, volume, SEC filings, press releases)
- Multilingual on-device preprocessing with privacy-preserving cloud inference
- Explainability with citations; drift detection; staged deployment

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo verification skeleton
async function verifyClaim(claim) {
  const sources = await fetchTimeAlignedData(claim.timestamp);
  const verification = await crossReferenceClaim(claim, sources);
  return {
    score: verification.misinformationScore,
    citations: verification.supportingSources,
    explanation: verification.reasoning
  };
}
```

